---
title: Browser extension · committed state and commands pushed to the bound tab
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant proc as Control-plane process
  participant pg as Postgres
  participant sock as Socket holder
  participant worker as Service worker
  participant page as Content surface
  participant sdk as Embedded SDK

  Note over proc: An API request, the voice<br/>agent, or an ingestion Job.
  proc->>pg: commit · record any command
  pg-->>sock: notify extension_control
  Note over sock: The API process holding the<br/>session's socket runs one<br/>projection pass.
  sock->>worker: changed state frames
  sock->>worker: claim once + route commands
  Note over worker: Validates and checkpoints.
  worker->>page: route to the exact surface
  opt visual command
    page->>sdk: resolve the target revision
    sdk-->>page: current target geometry
    Note over page: Cursor and scene
  end
  page-->>worker: command result
  worker-->>sock: terminal outcome + reason
  opt reconnect
    worker->>sock: resume · last acknowledged sequence
    Note over sock,worker: Frames above it are superseded, not replayed.
    sock->>worker: first pass · full current state
  end
